# ReVolt — AI-Powered Lithium-Ion Battery Reuse & Recycling Management Platform
Tagline: "Give Every Battery a Second Life."
RMK ReVolt Hackathon Finalist Prototype

## Quick Launch
Run the platform locally:
```bash
uv run uvicorn src.apps.api.main:app --host 127.0.0.1 --port 8000
```
Open in browser:
- Web Application: http://127.0.0.1:8000/
- API Docs (Swagger): http://127.0.0.1:8000/docs

Full documentation available in REVOLT_README.md.
